VISIBLE CODE [ '55\t\t−\t const defects={semanticMeasurements:row.semanticMeasurements??null,semanticDefects:row.semanticDefects??[],layoutDetails:row.layoutDetails??null,sourceEvidence:row.sourceEvidence??null,missing:row.missing??[],human:row.human??null};', '\t55\t+\t const defects={evidenceMissing:evidence.missing??[],semanticMeasurements:row.semanticMeasurements??null,semanticDefects:row.semanticDefects??[],layoutDetails:row.layoutDetails??null,sourceEvidence:row.sourceEvidence??null,missing:row.missing??[],human:row.human??null};', '56\t56\t\t return `<section class="panel"><h3>${name}</h3><p>修订 ${escape(row.revision??revision)} · 模型 ${escape(row.model??\'未记录\')}</p><p>交付状态：${escape(row.receipt?.delivery?.status??row.delivery?.status??row.status??\'未记录\')} · 评分状态：${escape(row.status??\'未记录\')} · 修复次数：${Number.isInteger(row.repairCount)&&row.repairCount>=0?row.repairCount:\'未记录\'}</p>${preview&&preview.endsWith(\'.png\')?`<img class="preview" src="${escape(preview)}" alt="${name}产物预览" loading="lazy">`:\'\'}<p class="evidence-links">${[[evidence.sourcePath,\'源文件\'],[evidence.artifactPath,\'最终产物\'],[evidence.sessionPath,\'完整会话\'],[evidence.promptPath,\'原始提示词\'],[evidence.receiptPath,\'原始测量记录\']].map(([path,label])=>link(path,label)).filter(Boolean).join(\' · \')}</p><p>候选历史：${evidence.historyComplete===true?\'完整\':evidence.historyComplete===false?\'不完整\':\'未记录\'}</p><ol>${candidates.map((item,index)=>`<li>${index===0?\'首次候选\':\'修复候选 \'+index}${index===candidates.length-1?\' / 最终候选\':\'\'} ${escape(item.submittedAt??\'\')} ${[[item.sourcePath,\'源文件\'],[item.artifactPath,\'产物\'],[item.receiptPath,\'交付凭据\']].map(([path,label])=>link(path,label)).filter(Boolean).join(\' · \')}</li>`).join(\'\')}</ol><details open><summary>语义、布局缺陷与缺测依据</summary><pre>${escape(JSON.stringify(defects,null,2))}</pre></details></section>`;' ]
